T: Domestic Violence
C: International
D: NA
O: Prof. Murray Straus
B: The bias against men is not restricted to false claims, it also involves hiding the truth at research level itself. An ample amount of evidence for this dishonesty is present in the research work of Murray Straus. Following is a list from his paper on different methods by which they hide the truth:
a) Conceal Evidence
b) Avoid obtaining evidence on female perpetrators.
c) Selective citation of research.
d) State Conclusions that contradict the data.
e) Block publication of articles that report gender symmetry.
f) Prevent funding of research to investigate female partner violence
g) Harass, threaten or penalize researchers who publish evidence on gender symmetry in female partner violence
